  "name": "Delta 100 Years (centennial)",
  "kind": "special",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "drawnOn": "A21N",
  "description": "Fuselage: White forward/upper fuselage; deep Delta blue rear fuselage and belly, separated by a sweeping silver supergraphic of swooping widget shapes that runs from mid-fuselage down and back. Cheatlines: Silver/light-blue sweep strokes. Tail: Blue fin with a large silver/white 'widget' triangle supergraphic. Engines: Blue cowlings. Winglets: Blue with white widget. Titles: Small 'DELTA' with red widget forward; huge navy '100' with 'YEARS' below on the forward fuselage. Artwork: '100' emblem also under the belly ('DELTA' visible under the fuselage). Colors hex: approximate.",
