  "notes": "Designed by Delta employee Aaliyah McNeal. Drawn from the A321neo N589DT (left side March 2025, right side at Hamburg Feb 2025) and checked against the A350 N527DN (Jan 2026); the design is the same on both, with the right side's widget aft of 'DELTA'. Light lettering on the dark belly behind the wing is visible from below but only partly legible, so it isn't drawn. The silver crescent ahead of the rear blue is clear on the A350, faint on the A321: its shape is approximate. Re-checked 2026-11-15: the sweeps, the crescent and the two stripes are curves on the photos (N589DT both sides) and are drawn smooth, their pointed lower ends kept as corners; titles already carry measured lengths. No measured A321 shape yet.",
  "from": "2025-03",
